# Per-run artefacts that are not kept (the committed runs hold result.json and the *_raceline.npz only):
# run logs and launcher logs (run.log, collect*.log, sweep*.log) and the waypoint-table drawings that
# bench_run.py writes next to result.json (initial_raceline.svg, final_raceline.svg).
*.log
benchmark_results/**/runs*/**/*.svg

